{# The memo as Markdown. Conventions the guardrail relies on (agents/guardrail.py):
   an entity name is bold, an id or a code is in backticks, and every number,
   date and name printed here is a value of the memo. No other digits. #}
{% macro cites(citations) %}{% for citation in citations %}{{ " [" if loop.first else "; " }}{{ citation | cite }}{{ "]" if loop.last }}{% endfor %}{% endmacro %}
{% macro claims_of(codes) %}
{% for claim in memo.claims if claim.code in codes %}
{% set p = claim.params %}
{% if claim.code == "DESIGNATED" %}
- {{ name(claim.subject_id) }} is reached by an active designation and is blocked.{{ cites(claim.citations) }}
{% elif claim.code == "POSSIBLY_DESIGNATED" %}
- {{ name(claim.subject_id) }} may be a designated party: the match is not settled.{{ cites(claim.citations) }}
{% elif claim.code == "BLOCKED_BY_OWNERSHIP" %}
- {{ name(claim.subject_id) }} is blocked by ownership: blocked owners hold {{ p.aggregate_pct | pct }} % of it.{{ cites(claim.citations) }}
{% elif claim.code == "POSSIBLY_BLOCKED_BY_OWNERSHIP" %}
- {{ name(claim.subject_id) }} is possibly blocked: blocked and possibly-blocked owners hold {{ p.aggregate_pct | pct }} % of it.{{ cites(claim.citations) }}
{% elif claim.code == "PRESUMED_MAJORITY" %}
- {{ name(claim.subject_id) }} is possibly blocked: a blocked or possibly-blocked parent holds a stake of unknown size, presumed a majority.{{ cites(claim.citations) }}
{% elif claim.code == "REASON" %}
- `{{ p.reason }}` on {{ subject(claim.subject_id) }}{% if p.pct is defined %}: {{ p.pct | pct }} %{% endif %}.{{ cites(claim.citations) }}
{% elif claim.code == "DATA_GAP" %}
- `{{ p.gap }}` on {{ subject(claim.subject_id) }} ({{ "decides" if p.decision_relevant else "for information" }}).{{ cites(claim.citations) }}
{% elif claim.code == "DIRECT_AGGREGATE" %}
- Blocked owners hold {{ p.aggregate_pct | pct }} % of {{ name(claim.subject_id) }} directly.{{ cites(claim.citations) }}
{% elif claim.code == "EFFECTIVE_EXPOSURE" %}
- Effective exposure of {{ name(claim.subject_id) }} (a risk signal, not the legal test): {% if p.sum_pct is not none %}{{ p.sum_pct | pct }} % over all paths, {{ p.max_pct | pct }} % on the largest{% else %}not known{% endif %}{% if p.has_unknown %}; a path has a stake of unknown size, so this is a lower bound{% endif %}.{{ cites(claim.citations) }}
{% elif claim.code == "NO_DESIGNATION_FOUND" %}
- No active designation reaches any of the {{ p.nodes_checked }} entities checked.{{ cites(claim.citations) }}
{% elif claim.code == "COVERAGE" %}
- Checked {{ p.nodes_checked }} entities and {{ p.edges_checked }} relationships; reached depth {{ p.depth_reached }} of at most {{ p.max_depth }}.{{ cites(claim.citations) }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endmacro %}
